<!-- Same "i" wordmark glyph as the in-app logo mark (onboarding/OnboardingChrome.kt's
     AndOnbTopBar) — dot + stem, sized to stay inside the standard 66dp safe
     zone of the 108dp adaptive-icon canvas so it isn't clipped by circular
     or squircle launcher masks. White fill also serves as the monochrome
     (Android 13+ themed icon) source — the OS re-tints from this shape's
     alpha channel, ignoring its RGB. -->
